{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42403","headline":"送程德琳郎中学士 · 徐锴","name":"送程德琳郎中学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瓜步妖氛灭，崑冈草树青。\n终朝空望极，今日送君行。\n报政秋云静，微吟晓月生。\n楼中长可见，特用灭离情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐锴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}